{"seq":1,"slug":"conditional-generation","title":"条件音乐生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation/conditional-generation","wordCount":1491,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"条件音乐生成\">条件音乐生成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>条件生成用外部信号引导模型产出满足需求的音乐，理解它需要抓住四个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>条件决定控制粒度</strong>：文本描述偏风格、参考音频管音色、哼唱锁旋律、和弦与 BPM 约束结构，粒度从粗到精。</li>\n<li><strong>CLAP 架起跨模态桥梁</strong>：对比学习得到文本-音频联合嵌入，是文本到音乐对齐的核心。</li>\n<li><strong>音频条件支持续写与填充</strong>：Continuation 延续动机、Inpainting 填补过渡、Style Reference 迁移风格。</li>\n<li><strong>多条件需要优先级机制</strong>：加权融合简单灵活，但条件冲突时质量下降，需 Negative Prompt 或级联化解。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四个要点共同回答了&quot;用什么控制、如何跨模态对齐、音频如何作条件、条件冲突怎么办&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件生成的框架\">条件生成的框架</h2><p>条件音乐生成（Conditional Music Generation）在无条件生成的基础上引入外部控制信号，引导模型生成满足特定需求的音乐。条件可以是文本描述、参考音频、标签、甚至图像或视频：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>or trained directly via </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x | c) = \\frac{P(c | x) \\cdot P(x)}{P(c)} \\quad \\text{or trained directly via } p_\\theta(x | c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">or trained directly via </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不同条件类型提供不同层级的控制粒度——从粗略的风格指定到精确的旋律约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件类型</th>\n<th>控制粒度</th>\n<th>输入形式</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本描述</td>\n<td>粗略（风格/情绪）</td>\n<td>自然语言句子</td>\n<td>MusicGen/MusicLM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参考音频</td>\n<td>中等（风格迁移）</td>\n<td>音频片段</td>\n<td>MusicLDM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旋律哼唱</td>\n<td>精确（音高轮廓）</td>\n<td>哼唱录音</td>\n<td>MusicLM melody</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和弦序列</td>\n<td>精确（和声骨架）</td>\n<td>和弦符号</td>\n<td>Anticipatory Music</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节拍/BPM</td>\n<td>精确（时间结构）</td>\n<td>数值/Click Track</td>\n<td>Stable Audio</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频画面</td>\n<td>粗略（情绪匹配）</td>\n<td>视频帧序列</td>\n<td>Video2Music</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MIDI 草稿</td>\n<td>精确（结构保留）</td>\n<td>MIDI 文件</td>\n<td>Arrangement模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 条件[&quot;条件信号&quot;]&#10;        TXT[&quot;文本&lt;br/&gt;A calm piano piece&quot;]&#10;        AUD[&quot;参考音频&lt;br/&gt;风格模板&quot;]&#10;        HUM[&quot;哼唱&lt;br/&gt;旋律轮廓&quot;]&#10;        CHD[&quot;和弦&lt;br/&gt;Cmaj-Amin-Fmaj-G&quot;]&#10;        VID[&quot;视频&lt;br/&gt;画面情绪&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 编码[&quot;条件编码器&quot;]&#10;        TE[&quot;文本编码器&lt;br/&gt;T5/CLAP&quot;]&#10;        AE[&quot;音频编码器&lt;br/&gt;CLAP/EnCodec&quot;]&#10;        ME[&quot;旋律编码器&lt;br/&gt;Pitch Extraction&quot;]&#10;        CE[&quot;和弦编码器&lt;br/&gt;Embedding&quot;]&#10;        VE[&quot;视频编码器&lt;br/&gt;CLIP/TimeSformer&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 生成模型[&quot;生成模型&quot;]&#10;        GM[&quot;Transformer/Diffusion&lt;br/&gt;条件融合生成&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 输出[&quot;输出&quot;]&#10;        MU[&quot;生成音乐&lt;br/&gt;满足条件约束&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    TXT --&gt; TE --&gt; GM&#10;    AUD --&gt; AE --&gt; GM&#10;    HUM --&gt; ME --&gt; GM&#10;    CHD --&gt; CE --&gt; GM&#10;    VID --&gt; VE --&gt; GM&#10;    GM --&gt; MU\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 条件[\"条件信号\"]\n        TXT[\"文本&lt;br/&gt;A calm piano piece\"]\n        AUD[\"参考音频&lt;br/&gt;风格模板\"]\n        HUM[\"哼唱&lt;br/&gt;旋律轮廓\"]\n        CHD[\"和弦&lt;br/&gt;Cmaj-Amin-Fmaj-G\"]\n        VID[\"视频&lt;br/&gt;画面情绪\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 编码[\"条件编码器\"]\n        TE[\"文本编码器&lt;br/&gt;T5/CLAP\"]\n        AE[\"音频编码器&lt;br/&gt;CLAP/EnCodec\"]\n        ME[\"旋律编码器&lt;br/&gt;Pitch Extraction\"]\n        CE[\"和弦编码器&lt;br/&gt;Embedding\"]\n        VE[\"视频编码器&lt;br/&gt;CLIP/TimeSformer\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 生成模型[\"生成模型\"]\n        GM[\"Transformer/Diffusion&lt;br/&gt;条件融合生成\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 输出[\"输出\"]\n        MU[\"生成音乐&lt;br/&gt;满足条件约束\"]\n    end\n    TXT --&gt; TE --&gt; GM\n    AUD --&gt; AE --&gt; GM\n    HUM --&gt; ME --&gt; GM\n    CHD --&gt; CE --&gt; GM\n    VID --&gt; VE --&gt; GM\n    GM --&gt; MU</pre><h2 id=\"文本到音乐生成\">文本到音乐生成</h2><p>Text-to-Music 是最自然的人机接口——用户用自然语言描述想要的音乐，模型生成匹配的音频。技术挑战在于跨模态对齐：将语义空间映射到音乐空间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CLAP Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>cos</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>text</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>prompt</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>audio</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>generated</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CLAP Score} = \\text{cos}(E_{\\text{text}}(\\text{prompt}), E_{\\text{audio}}(\\text{generated}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLAP Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cos</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">text</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prompt</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">audio</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">generated</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CLAP（Contrastive Language-Audio Pretraining）通过对比学习训练文本-音频联合嵌入空间，是连接文本描述与音频生成的桥梁。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文本描述维度</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>模型可理解度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>风格/流派</td>\n<td>&quot;jazz&quot;, &quot;electronic&quot;, &quot;classical&quot;</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情绪/氛围</td>\n<td>&quot;calm&quot;, &quot;energetic&quot;, &quot;dark&quot;</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乐器</td>\n<td>&quot;piano&quot;, &quot;guitar&quot;, &quot;synthesizer&quot;</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节奏</td>\n<td>&quot;slow tempo&quot;, &quot;fast beat&quot;, &quot;120 BPM&quot;</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构</td>\n<td>&quot;starts quiet, builds to climax&quot;</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>具体旋律</td>\n<td>&quot;melody goes up then down&quot;</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和声细节</td>\n<td>&quot;use minor seventh chords&quot;</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 文本处理[&quot;文本条件处理&quot;]&#10;        P[&quot;用户Prompt&lt;br/&gt;A dreamy ambient pad&quot;]&#10;        T5[&quot;T5/FLAN编码&lt;br/&gt;语义嵌入&quot;]&#10;        CL[&quot;CLAP编码&lt;br/&gt;音频对齐嵌入&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 融合[&quot;条件融合&quot;]&#10;        CA[&quot;Cross-Attention&lt;br/&gt;文本→音频&quot;]&#10;        AD[&quot;加性条件&lt;br/&gt;直接加到隐层&quot;]&#10;        CF[&quot;CFG&lt;br/&gt;引导强度控制&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 模型[&quot;生成&quot;]&#10;        GEN[&quot;Transformer/UNet&lt;br/&gt;条件化生成&quot;]&#10;        OUT[&quot;音频输出&lt;br/&gt;10-30秒&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    P --&gt; T5 --&gt; CA&#10;    P --&gt; CL --&gt; AD&#10;    CA --&gt; GEN&#10;    AD --&gt; GEN&#10;    CF --&gt; GEN&#10;    GEN --&gt; OUT\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 文本处理[\"文本条件处理\"]\n        P[\"用户Prompt&lt;br/&gt;A dreamy ambient pad\"]\n        T5[\"T5/FLAN编码&lt;br/&gt;语义嵌入\"]\n        CL[\"CLAP编码&lt;br/&gt;音频对齐嵌入\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 融合[\"条件融合\"]\n        CA[\"Cross-Attention&lt;br/&gt;文本→音频\"]\n        AD[\"加性条件&lt;br/&gt;直接加到隐层\"]\n        CF[\"CFG&lt;br/&gt;引导强度控制\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 模型[\"生成\"]\n        GEN[\"Transformer/UNet&lt;br/&gt;条件化生成\"]\n        OUT[\"音频输出&lt;br/&gt;10-30秒\"]\n    end\n    P --&gt; T5 --&gt; CA\n    P --&gt; CL --&gt; AD\n    CA --&gt; GEN\n    AD --&gt; GEN\n    CF --&gt; GEN\n    GEN --&gt; OUT</pre><h2 id=\"音频条件与续写\">音频条件与续写</h2><p>音频条件生成包括两个主要场景：(1) 给定起始片段续写后续音乐（Audio Continuation），(2) 给定参考音频模仿其风格（Style Transfer）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(续写)</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>content</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(风格迁移)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x_{t:T} | x_{0:t}) \\quad \\text{(续写)} \\quad P(x&#x27; | x_{\\text{ref}}, c_{\\text{content}}) \\quad \\text{(风格迁移)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">续写</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">content</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">风格迁移</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>音频条件模式</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>控制内容</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Continuation</td>\n<td>前几秒音频</td>\n<td>延续风格和动机</td>\n<td>创作辅助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inpainting</td>\n<td>两端音频（中间空白）</td>\n<td>填补过渡段</td>\n<td>音乐编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style Reference</td>\n<td>完整参考曲</td>\n<td>提取风格特征</td>\n<td>风格化生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Melody Conditioning</td>\n<td>哼唱/单旋律</td>\n<td>保留旋律线</td>\n<td>编曲/和声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stem Mixing</td>\n<td>部分分轨</td>\n<td>生成缺失声部</td>\n<td>自动编曲</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 续写[&quot;Audio Continuation&quot;]&#10;        IN[&quot;输入: 前5秒音频&quot;]&#10;        ENC[&quot;编码为Token/Latent&quot;]&#10;        GEN[&quot;自回归续写&lt;br/&gt;保持一致性&quot;]&#10;        OUT1[&quot;输出: 续写30秒&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 填充[&quot;Inpainting&quot;]&#10;        L[&quot;左段音频&quot;]&#10;        R[&quot;右段音频&quot;]&#10;        MASK[&quot;中间Mask区域&quot;]&#10;        FILL[&quot;条件扩散填充&lt;br/&gt;过渡平滑&quot;]&#10;        OUT2[&quot;输出: 完整段落&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    IN --&gt; ENC --&gt; GEN --&gt; OUT1&#10;    L --&gt; FILL&#10;    R --&gt; FILL&#10;    MASK --&gt; FILL&#10;    FILL --&gt; OUT2\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 续写[\"Audio Continuation\"]\n        IN[\"输入: 前5秒音频\"]\n        ENC[\"编码为Token/Latent\"]\n        GEN[\"自回归续写&lt;br/&gt;保持一致性\"]\n        OUT1[\"输出: 续写30秒\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 填充[\"Inpainting\"]\n        L[\"左段音频\"]\n        R[\"右段音频\"]\n        MASK[\"中间Mask区域\"]\n        FILL[\"条件扩散填充&lt;br/&gt;过渡平滑\"]\n        OUT2[\"输出: 完整段落\"]\n    end\n    IN --&gt; ENC --&gt; GEN --&gt; OUT1\n    L --&gt; FILL\n    R --&gt; FILL\n    MASK --&gt; FILL\n    FILL --&gt; OUT2</pre><h2 id=\"多条件组合与冲突处理\">多条件组合与冲突处理</h2><p>实际应用中用户常指定多个条件（如&quot;用钢琴弹爵士风格，120BPM，忧伤情绪&quot;），模型需要同时满足所有约束。当条件之间存在冲突时（如&quot;快节奏 + 催眠放松&quot;），需要优先级机制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Combined Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Combined Score} = \\sum_i \\lambda_i \\cdot S(x, c_i), \\quad \\sum_i \\lambda_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Combined Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合策略</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加权求和</td>\n<td>多条件嵌入加权平均</td>\n<td>简单灵活</td>\n<td>冲突时质量下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cross-Attention 串联</td>\n<td>每层多条件交叉注意力</td>\n<td>精细控制</td>\n<td>计算成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>级联生成</td>\n<td>逐步应用条件</td>\n<td>优先级明确</td>\n<td>后续条件受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Negative Prompt</td>\n<td>排除不想要的特征</td>\n<td>精确排除</td>\n<td>不能直接指定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 多条件[&quot;多条件输入&quot;]&#10;        C1[&quot;风格: Jazz&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;乐器: Piano&quot;]&#10;        C3[&quot;情绪: Melancholic&quot;]&#10;        C4[&quot;BPM: 90&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 融合策略[&quot;融合策略&quot;]&#10;        W[&quot;加权融合&lt;br/&gt;λ1·e1 + λ2·e2 + ...&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 生成[&quot;生成结果&quot;]&#10;        OK[&quot;条件兼容&lt;br/&gt;高质量输出&quot;]&#10;        CF[&quot;条件冲突&lt;br/&gt;折中/降质&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    C1 --&gt; W&#10;    C2 --&gt; W&#10;    C3 --&gt; W&#10;    C4 --&gt; W&#10;    W --&gt; OK&#10;    W --&gt; CF\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 多条件[\"多条件输入\"]\n        C1[\"风格: Jazz\"]\n        C2[\"乐器: Piano\"]\n        C3[\"情绪: Melancholic\"]\n        C4[\"BPM: 90\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 融合策略[\"融合策略\"]\n        W[\"加权融合&lt;br/&gt;λ1·e1 + λ2·e2 + ...\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 生成[\"生成结果\"]\n        OK[\"条件兼容&lt;br/&gt;高质量输出\"]\n        CF[\"条件冲突&lt;br/&gt;折中/降质\"]\n    end\n    C1 --&gt; W\n    C2 --&gt; W\n    C3 --&gt; W\n    C4 --&gt; W\n    W --&gt; OK\n    W --&gt; CF</pre><h2 id=\"controlnet-思路在音乐中的应用\">ControlNet 思路在音乐中的应用</h2><p>受图像生成领域 ControlNet 的启发，音乐生成也开始引入更精细的结构化控制——用额外的控制网络注入时序结构信息，而不修改主生成模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>ControlNet</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>structure</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t, t, c) + \\text{ControlNet}(x_t, t, c_{\\text{structure}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ControlNet</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">structure</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构控制信号</th>\n<th>类比图像ControlNet</th>\n<th>音乐用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节拍网格</td>\n<td>边缘检测图</td>\n<td>强制节拍对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音量包络</td>\n<td>深度图</td>\n<td>控制动态走势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和弦标注</td>\n<td>语义分割图</td>\n<td>和声骨架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旋律音高</td>\n<td>姿态骨架</td>\n<td>旋律轮廓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频谱掩码</td>\n<td>涂鸦/区域</td>\n<td>频率分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种&quot;即插即用&quot;的控制方式让用户可以选择性地约束生成结果的某些维度，同时让其他维度由模型自由发挥——比全条件化更灵活，比无条件更可控。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制强度</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0% (无控制)</td>\n<td>自由生成</td>\n<td>灵感探索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30–50%</td>\n<td>软性引导</td>\n<td>建议性控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70–90%</td>\n<td>强引导</td>\n<td>精确创作需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>严格约束</td>\n<td>固定骨架填充</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>精确可控的条件生成是 AI 音乐从&quot;技术演示&quot;走向&quot;创作工具&quot;的关键能力——创作者需要的不是随机的好音乐，而是满足特定创作意图的音乐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>条件类型决定控制粒度：文本偏风格、音频管音色、哼唱锁旋律、和弦与 BPM 约束结构。</li>\n<li>文本到音乐依赖 CLAP 等跨模态嵌入，实现语义空间与音乐空间的对齐。</li>\n<li>音频条件涵盖续写、填充与风格参考，覆盖创作辅助与音乐编辑场景。</li>\n<li>多条件组合用加权融合或交叉注意力，冲突时需优先级与 Negative Prompt。</li>\n<li>ControlNet 思路为音乐引入即插即用的结构化控制，控制强度可按需调节。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"条件音乐生成","id":"条件音乐生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"条件生成的框架","id":"条件生成的框架"},{"level":2,"text":"文本到音乐生成","id":"文本到音乐生成"},{"level":2,"text":"音频条件与续写","id":"音频条件与续写"},{"level":2,"text":"多条件组合与冲突处理","id":"多条件组合与冲突处理"},{"level":2,"text":"ControlNet 思路在音乐中的应用","id":"controlnet-思路在音乐中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"VAE 与潜空间音乐模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/generative-models/vae-latent"},"next":{"title":"风格迁移与融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation/style-transfer"}}